WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the God of Waves — Episode 2 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Your daughter?

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I seduced many sailors in the past.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.780
And a relationship with one of them bore fruit.

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:16.310
But I was left with nothing.

5
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.310
You will marry my daughter so that she grows up.

6
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.310
This will not last forever.

7
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.310
Five years.

8
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.310
Take care of her for five years.

9
00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.310
Help her succeed.

10
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:31.310
On the fifth wedding anniversary,

11
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:33.310
the spell will be broken.

12
00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:37.310
And if you love her, reveal your true identity to her.

13
00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:45.140
This may seem strange, but…

14
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.140
Your daughter doesn't look like you, does she?

15
00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:51.740
You will judge for yourself.
